  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with o→ue stem change in present and subjuntivo (except nosotros, which keeps the infinitive stem *soñ-*)",
    "No stem change in preterite, imperfect, future, or conditional",
    "Past participle: *soñado*",
    "*soñar con algo/alguien* = to dream about something/someone (*Soñé con el mar* — I dreamed about the sea)",
    "*soñar despierto* = to daydream (*Deja de soñar despierto* — Stop daydreaming)",
    "*ni soñarlo* / *ni en sueños* = not a chance, not in your dreams",
    "*soñar en grande* = to dream big",
    "Related: *el sueño* = dream, sleep; *el/la soñador/a* = dreamer; *soñoliento/a* = sleepy, drowsy"
  ],
